{'symbol': 'PEG', 'date': '2023-05-31 16:30:00', 'title': 'PSEG COMPLETES SALE OF ITS 25% EQUITY INTEREST IN OCEAN WIND 1 TO ØRSTED N.A.', 'text': 'NEWARK, N.J. , MAY 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PUBLIC SERVICE ENTERPRISE GROUP INCORPORATED TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE SALE OF ITS 25% EQUITY INTEREST IN THE 1,100-MEGAWATT OCEAN WIND 1 PROJECT TO ØRSTED NORTH AMERICA (ØRSTED N.A.'}